%% draw-visual:
sequenceDiagram
  autonumber
  participant P0 as Chooser
  participant P1 as Queue + clock
  participant P2 as Decisions
  participant P3 as Sim world
  participant P4 as Checks+trace
  P0->>P3: fault: a unreachable
  P0->>P1: exec Y1 on b
  P1->>P2: deliver Y1
  P2->>P3: effect: dispatch
  Note over P4: bound: Y1 done by t60
  Note over P0,P4: chosen fault: agent-plane crashes, store and guests persist
  Note over P2: rebuild from durable state
  P2->>P3: effect: inspect a, b
  P3->>P1: completion: Y1 running
  Note over P3: a: nothing arrives
  P0->>P1: fair pick: b
  P3->>P1: completion: Y1 exit 0
  P1->>P2: deliver exit 0
  P2->>P4: state + effects, every step
  P1->>P4: clock reaches t60
  Note over P4: Y1 done? else list pending
